-df-functor</a> 的三参数定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 在本页定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor\\text{-}legacy} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Functor}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Functor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor\\text{-}legacy} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Functor}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Functor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对象映射、态射映射、恒等与复合保持条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D$ 为范畴，$F=(F_0,F_1)$ 为候选记录；$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]] 的三参数定义，$\\mathrm{Functor}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 在本页定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对象映射、态射映射、恒等与复合保持条件见 [[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fu